      "dcterms:title": "Drinfeld twist for quantum su(2) in the adjoint representation",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "Chryssomalakos∗, Chryssomalis"
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20210521",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/q-alg/9707006",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We give a detailed description of the adjoint representation of Drinfeld’s twist element, as well as of its coproduct, for suq(2). We also discuss, as applications, the computation of the universal R-matrix in this representation and the problem of symmetrization of identical-particle states with quantum su(2) symmetry. ∗e-mail address: chryss@stp.dias.ie",
